Z||000000||FieroMaster88||09-13-2001||12:02 AM||||Ok....this is truly odd.  My firend came up with this, I simply put the numbers together!<P>Ok...the attack on the United States happened on 9/11/01.  <BR>911 is a code for emergency...<BR>The first flight to crash was flight 11<P>The second flight was 175, 1+7+5=13<P>The third flight was 77, 7+7=14<P>The fourth was 93, 9+3=12<P>Every one of the final numbers are the dates leading from the attack to Friday!!!!  11, 12,13 and 14!!!!  Is this like a warning they dont count on us finding or a councidince?  This was a well planned attack..could this have been planned too?!?!?!  I need to find some more info.  <P>Everyone keep safe!<P>------------------<BR>             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">            <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo||||reg||4
