Z||000003||FieroMaster88||09-13-2001||12:07 AM||||100% sure they are the flight numbers...IN ORDER OF CRASHED!!!  Looked it up on the net.  This is friggin odd.....scares the crap out of me!<P>So what do we do???  Think anyone else has noticed this?!?!?! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> <BR>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">             <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo<p>[This message has been edited by FieroMaster88 (edited 09-13-2001).]||||reg||1
