Z||000008||artherd||09-13-2001||04:10 AM||||I bet you could connect the terrorists to Kevin Bacon in 6-steps...  <P>That said, It's probally not far-featched *enough* to have any truth for it...<P>I love how fast the investigations are proceeding, how much we suddenly 'noticed' that should have been noticed long before.<P>Beware of people with three names.<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000009||LZeitgeist||09-13-2001||08:02 AM||||"Conspiracy Theories" are so easy to make up and piece together after the fact because it is human nature to seek order out of chaos.<P>I don't think the flight numbers had anything to do with anything. These are not subtle people that did this - any statements they wished to make would be plain for the world to see. We wouldn't have to make up some sort of mathematical problem in order to see what was in their minds - they would make sure of that.<P>Just one of a hundred more 'theories' regarding these events that will be suggested and sensationalized over the coming decade. I put no stock in it. <P>The facts stand on their own - the facts will be what they are punished for, not unprovable theories.||||reg||1
Z||000010||LZeitgeist||09-13-2001||08:30 AM||||Also, from a post I read on another board...<P>The problem with numerology is that you HAVE to remain consistent in your application of it...<P>To wit:<P>11 = todays date<BR>93 (9+3) = tomorrow's date<BR>175 (1+7+5) = thursday's date<BR>77 (7+7) = friday's date.<P>Check your first column.<BR>1 + 1 = 2<BR>NOT 11....<P>It's like Sesame Street's "One of these things is not like the other".<BR>If you're adding the numbers together in three of the four columns, you CAN'T apply a different standard to the fourth column to make it "suit your needs".<P>It doesn't work that way.||||reg||1
Z||000011||rogergarrison||09-13-2001||10:56 AM||||this isnt a theory, it is a conspiracy, because it involved many people to pull it off. I think they probably just waited for a day that had perfect weather so they could see their target visually and there was no chance of flights being delayed. I also think they did it early in the morning too because flight delays normally start out ok and build during the day. It wouldnt have worked if one of them was delayed an hour or two somewhere. Everyone would have known what was going on after the first impact.||||reg||1
Z||000012||LZeitgeist||09-13-2001||11:19 AM||||I'm not saying the attack wasn't a conspiracy - obviously many people worked together to achieve it.<P>However, adding numbers together to come up with some sort of 'clue' after the fact, or putting the first letter in each of the passenger's names on each of the flights to find out that they spelled out the name of the mastermind behind the atacks, or calculating that since 6 of the people on the first flight had eggs for breakfast, 6 of the people on the second flight had steak for breakfast, and 6 of the people on the third flight had ham for breakfast, so it must be the work of the Devil - it's all a bunch of wasted time, trying to interject some sort of fantastical 'sense' into the chaos created by the situation.<P>Of course it was a conspiracy - but it was a conspiracy in the definition of being put into effect by a number of people working together towards the same goal - it wasn't a conspiracy in the definition of secret signs and hidden meanings.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000013||FieroMaster88||09-13-2001||12:36 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LZeitgeist:<BR><B>Also, from a post I read on another board...<P>The problem with numerology is that you HAVE to remain consistent in your application of it...<P>To wit:<P>11 = todays date<BR>93 (9+3) = tomorrow's date<BR>175 (1+7+5) = thursday's date<BR>77 (7+7) = friday's date.<P>Check your first column.<BR>1 + 1 = 2<BR>NOT 11....<P>It's like Sesame Street's "One of these things is not like the other".<BR>If you're adding the numbers together in three of the four columns, you CAN'T apply a different standard to the fourth column to make it "suit your needs".<P>It doesn't work that way.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yeah..Already know that.  I just thought it was odd....but then again lots of things right now seem odd.  <P>And who ever said anything about this being the work of the Devil?!?!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">  I just simply pointed out something I found odd.  It is amazing how people can draw f**ked up conclusions about someone from a post like this on the forum.  I had someone E-mail me and tell me I am one of those people who enjoy scaring the crap out of people by making up things that are not true.  It just shows me that people cant even come together and treat each others as equals in bad times.  Everyone allways has to try to insult someone or bash someones intelligence just so THEY can look like the better person. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  What a sad world it has become.  <P>I am done reading any of these posts, and arguing with anyone.  All this energy we use arguing about stupid S**T should be spend praying for the people who lost their lives and loved ones in this terrible act of violence!  I didnt want to stur up negative attention...so go ahead and lock this thread Cliff. <P>Have a great day  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR><P>------------