Z||000016||Oreif||09-13-2001||06:53 PM||||I received this in an Email. Someone has way too much time on their hands.<P>The date of the attack:  9/11 - 9+1+1 = 11 <BR>September 11th is the 254th day of the year - 2+5+4 = 11 <BR>After September 11th there are 111 days left to the end of the year <BR>119 is the area code to Iran/Iraq - 1+1+9 = 11 or backwards for 9/11 <BR>Twin Towers standing side by side looks like the number 11 <BR>The first plane to hit the towers was flight 11 <P>I have more...... <P>State of NY was the 11th state added to the Union <BR>New York City - 11 letters <BR>Afghanistan - 11 letters <BR>The Pentagon - 11 letters <BR>Ramzi Yousef - 11 letters (convicted of orchestrating the attack on the WTC in 1993) <BR>Flight 11 - 92 passengers on board - 9+2 = 11 <BR>Flight 77 - 65 passengers on board - 6+5 = 11 <BR>||||reg||2
Z||000017||Urchin||09-13-2001||06:59 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B>I received this in an Email. Someone has way too much time on their hands.<P>The date of the attack:  9/11 - 9+1+1 = 11 <BR>September 11th is the 254th day of the year - 2+5+4 = 11 <BR>After September 11th there are 111 days left to the end of the year <BR>119 is the area code to Iran/Iraq - 1+1+9 = 11 or backwards for 9/11 <BR>Twin Towers standing side by side looks like the number 11 <BR>The first plane to hit the towers was flight 11 <P>I have more...... <P>State of NY was the 11th state added to the Union <BR>New York City - 11 letters <BR>Afghanistan - 11 letters <BR>The Pentagon - 11 letters <BR>Ramzi Yousef - 11 letters (convicted of orchestrating the attack on the WTC in 1993) <BR>Flight 11 - 92 passengers on board - 9+2 = 11 <BR>Flight 77 - 65 passengers on board - 6+5 = 11 </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I think you are right.  Someone has way too much time on their hands!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>Nevertheless, assuming this is all meaningless, it is still very odd...  interesting in fact.<P>By the way... the twin towers resembling the #11.  That's just funny  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Urchin (edited 09-13-2001).]||||reg||1
